; The official MCP SDK and its dependencies are built against 10.0.0.13 of these assemblies, but Visual Studio 2026
; ships 10.0.0.10 and only redirects requests up to 10.0.0.10 (see devenv.exe.config). Extend each redirect so every
; caller shares Visual Studio's copy. Bundling a second copy would create two incompatible versions of types such as
; JsonElement. ProvideBindingRedirection cannot express this (it only validates upward redirects against the
; referenced assembly), so the entries are written by hand. Re-check versions and tokens when Visual Studio or the SDK changes.

